        "original_id": "eb210679-307c-5538-b02a-ef35a396b46c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jimi Mistry, Om Puri, Linda Bassett\n- Works: EastEnders, Coronation Street, East Is East, Blood Diamond, The Guru, Exam, West Is West, Ella Enchanted, The Truth About Love\n- Places: Salford, Lancashire\n- Concepts: English actors, film settings, mixed-ethnicity British households\n\nFacts:\n- Jimi Mistry was born on 1 January 1973 and is an English actor.\n- Jimi Mistry is best known for roles in EastEnders and Coronation Street.\n- Jimi Mistry appeared in films including East Is East, Blood Diamond, The Guru, Exam, West Is West, Ella Enchanted, and The Truth About Love.\n- East Is East is set in 1971 in Salford, Lancashire.\n- East Is East depicts a mixed-ethnicity British household led by Pakistani father George, played by Om Puri, and English mother Ella, played by Linda Bassett.",
